<article class="env-situation" id="0GBC">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0GBC">Situation <span data-tag="0GBC">87.21.6</span>.</a> Let $P$ be a local property of morphisms of $\textit{WAdm}^{count}$, see Situation <a href="/tag/0CBA" data-tag="0CBA">87.21.2</a>. We say $P$ is <em>stable under base change</em> if given $B \to A$ and $B \to C$ in $\textit{WAdm}^{count}$ we have $P(B \to A) \Rightarrow P(C \to A \widehat{\otimes }_ B C)$. This makes sense as $A \widehat{\otimes }_ B C$ is an object of $\textit{WAdm}^{count}$ by Lemma <a href="/tag/0GB4" data-tag="0GB4">87.4.12</a>. </p>
</article>